     1916                     and buf_chk-gds-pay.cpline-num = temp-chk-pay.line-num
     1917                     and buf_chk-gds-pay.pay-card = temp-chk-pay.pay-card exclusive-lock no-error.
     1918                     if not available buf_chk-gds-pay then do:
